                    "text": "Multi-course meals with a choice of Western, Asian, and Indian dishes",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Salads, fresh bread rolls, and more substantial entrees",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Rotating desserts and fruit plates",
                    "depth": 0
