                      "heading": "Special Meal Requests"
                    },
                    "text": "For all classes, a wide range of special meal requests (Vegan, Jain, Gluten-Free, Kosher, Child-friendly, Diabetic-friendly, and more) is available to pre-order when booking or through \"Manage My Flight.\""
                  }
                ],
